---
import BaseLayout from '../../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro';
import PagedShelf from '../../components/review/PagedShelf.astro';
import {getShelfCatalog} from '../../lib/shelf-catalog';
const {documents,collections}=await getShelfCatalog();
---
<BaseLayout title="Research Collections | FTFN"><section class="page-section"><h1 class="page-title">Documents, organized around the stack.</h1><p class="lede">{collections.length} collections and {documents.length} document records, with complete static pagination and metadata search.</p><p>Inherited publisher and publication labels are not evidence of independent review. Some records describe FTFN methods; their claim-level classification remains open. Strategy, funding and test documents do not by themselves establish delivered operations.</p></section><section class="page-section"><h2>Collections</h2><PagedShelf records={collections} kind="collections" limit={10} headingLevel={3}/></section><section class="page-section" id="document-shelf"><h2>Document shelf</h2><PagedShelf records={documents} kind="documents" limit={30} headingLevel={3}/></section></BaseLayout>
